        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nWell-Appointed 3 Bedroom Mid-Terrace Home Extending to Approx. 64 m²\r\n\r\nRAYWHITE·IE Property are delighted to present 46 Pearse Park, a charming three-bedroom mid-terrace residence situated in one of Drogheda's most established and convenient residential locations. Extending to approximately 64 m², this property offers bright and practical accommodation throughout and presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a home with the potential for modernization and energy upgrades.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, spacious living/dining room with feature fireplace, kitchen, guest WC, rear porch and storage area on the ground floor. The first floor provides three bedrooms and a shower room.\r\n\r\nSituated within walking distance of Drogheda Town Centre, the property enjoys immediate access to schools, shops, cafés, public transport and a wide range of local amenities.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nApprox. 64m²\r\nThree-bedroom mid-terrace residence\r\nSpacious living/dining area\r\nFeature fireplace\r\nGround floor WC\r\nThree first-floor bedrooms\r\nRear porch and storage area\r\nMature residential setting\r\nWalking distance to Drogheda Town Centre\r\nConvenient access to schools, shops and transport links\r\nExcellent refurbishment potential\r\n\r\nBER: G\r\n\r\nViewing Highly Recommended - Please contact Declan."
